DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTSTAMP:20261012T200632Z
UID:c189e2398b3c78c2cedcb61d7ce6@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Lyme Art Association (LAA) is proud to announce New England La
 ndscape\, its annual juried exhibition celebrating the rich and varied cha
 rm of the East Coast\, where nature's artistry unfolds in breathtaking bea
 uty. This gorgeous art show includes rolling hills covered with trees\, lo
 nely roads\, cow-dotted farmlands\, historical homes\, and bustling townsc
 apes\, all done in various mediums that visually explore people’s connec
 tion to this extraordinary and gorgeous terrain.\n\nSource: https://ctvisi
 t.com/events/new-england-landscape-bon-appetit-exhibitions
