DESCRIPTION:How much of Ridgefield has changed over the past 150 years and
  how much remains the same? This will be Town Historian Jack Sanders’ to
 pic in an illustrated talk for the Ridgefield History Club on Tuesday\, Oc
 tober 20\, 2026\, at 10 a.m. at the Ridgefield Historical Society’s Scot
 t House\, 4 Sunset Lane. The Ridgefield History Club is an informal commun
 ity storytelling program of the Ridgefield Historical Society. The group m
 eets for an hour on the third Tuesday of every month to explore a specific
  topic in Ridgefield’s history through shared conversation.\n\nSource: h
